usage
=====

enable the docker daemon:

  ln -s /etc/sv/dockerd /var/service

the service loads the 'loop' module, mounts cgroups and starts dockerd
with '-G docker'. add your user to the 'docker' group to use docker
without root (log in again afterwards):

  addgroup <user> docker

dockerd options can be changed in /etc/sv/dockerd/conf:

  OPTS="-p /var/run/docker.pid -G docker"
